# Keep LF line endings on every platform. The runtime bundle test compares runtime/src with
# runtime/dist byte by byte, and Windows checkouts would otherwise convert them to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gz binary
*.pptx binary
*.ttf binary
# Ecma file, kept byte-identical (CRLF, BOM)
internal/pptx/geom/presetShapeDefinitions.xml -text
